brackets in Sage's Lie algebra: L3 L1 L2
Jacobi identity holds (Sage checks it when building the algebra): True
the matrices L_a satisfy the same brackets: True
Killing form in the basis L_a:
[-2  0  0]
[ 0 -2  0]
[ 0  0 -2]
equals -2 delta_ab: True ; negative definite (compact): True
Sage recognises the algebra as simple of type A1 = su(2): True
